error[RB0108]: event `Go` is declared twice
 --> RB0108-raise-names.road:3:18
  |
2 |   event Go
  |         -- first declared here
3 |   internal event Go
  |                  ^^
  |
  = help: the events a machine accepts, raises and emits share one set of names

error[RB0108]: `ping` is already a parameter of `M`
 --> RB0108-raise-names.road:7:32
  |
1 | machine M(ping: int) {
  |           ---- first declared here
...
7 |     on Go raise Go after 1s as ping  raise Go after 2s as pong  raise Go after 3s as ok
  |                                ^^^^
  |
  = help: a delayed raise's name shares the machine's names with its parameters, variables and collections

