  = help: a delayed raise's name shares the machine's names with its parameters, variables and collections

error[RB0205]: trigger `on Go` is written twice in `M.A`
 --> RB0108-raise-names.road:8:5
  |
7 |     on Go raise Go after 1s as ping  raise Go after 2s as pong  raise Go after 3s as ok
  |     ----- first written here
8 |     on Go -> A  raise Go after 4s as ok
  |     ^^^^^
  |
  = help: put every branch in one block, where their order is explicit: `on Go { if … -> A  else -> B }`
